            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Xèo Tôm Nhảy Năm Hiền",
            "review_text": "TravelEatXplore\nBoston, Massachusetts5216 contributions\n0\nSmall banh xeo\nMay 2018 • Family\nOrdered 2 types of bang xeo. One is with shrimps and other is squid. I was taking back how small the banh xeo's were. They are flavorful, but the flower for the banh xeo took in a lot of oil. The banh xeo are crispy. It comes with lettuce and green plants with fish dipping sauce. Also ordered ground pork on a stick and deep fried spring rolls. Spring rolls were over cooked. The pork skewers were good, but small. The banh xeo were about 1usd each. The yellow bean dessert were good and refreshing. Food came out quick.\nRead more\nWritten May 7, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
